    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Store 2.",
      "worked": "Compare the cost of 15 mangoes at each store.\n\nStore 1:\n$$\\begin{align*}3\\text{ mangoes}:\\$8 &= 15\\text{ mangoes}:\\$40\\end{align*}$$\nStore 2:\n$$\\begin{align*}5\\text{ mangoes}:\\$13 &= 15\\text{ mangoes}:\\$39\\end{align*}$$\nStore 2 offers the best unit price because the same number of mangoes costs less.",
